 "remarks": "Stunning Colonial in Havemeyer Park, Old Greenwich, on a 0.38-acre cul-de-sac lot, offers resort-style living with a pool, deck, and built-in barbecue. Inside, find hardwood floors and sunlit rooms. The main floor includes a living room, family room with fireplace, breakfast room, gourmet kitchen with Sub-Zero and Wolf appliances, dining room, powder room, and mudroom. The second floor boasts a primary suite with tray ceiling, walk-in closets, spa bath, plus three bedrooms, hall bath, and laundry. A private guest suite is above the garage with a separate entrance.The lower level features a full bath, playroom, and utility room. Minutes from Old Greenwich Village, Metro North, and Tod's Point beach.",
